  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Strengthening Social Protection in Masmiyyeh, Dar&#x2019;a</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">ltpgtThrough studying the target community and working with focus groups, there are many of the target segment who are exposed to the risk of protection, including exploitation, harassment, child labor, and early marriage for girls. It is noteworthy that there is no type of protection awareness whatsoever, whether a community center or private awareness sessions within School clusters, as there are no experienced specialists in this field, in addition to the fact that they are among the fragile and marginalized communities.ltbrgtIn this context, the work team also went to educational gatherings, and it was confirmed by school principals that there are children from the target segment, males and females, who are exposed to the risk of protection in all its forms, and some of them are exposed to gender-based violence due to family separation and the lack of a caregiver to guide the child in the correct behavior, so the intervention is based on the need and spreading awareness among the target group and the caregiver as well through trained, equipped and specialized teams, where the intervention for protection will be in two parts:ltbrgt1- Distribution of winter clothing rations to protect against the cold of winter&#xa0;lt/pgtltpgt2- Distribution of hygiene kits&#xa0;ltbrgt3- Protection activities, psychological support and case management.ltbrgtlt/pgt</narrative>
  </description>
